        "start": 0,
        "end": 428,
        "quote": "Between January 2020 and April 2024, 498 out of 748 eligible patients provided informed consent and were included in the study, during which breath tests were performed. Ninety-two patients were excluded due to a failed breath test (n = 38), changes in health status (n = 30), technical issues (n = 19), wrong inclusion (n = 3), or loss to follow up (n = 2). A total of 406 patients completed breath tests suitable for analysis."
